# Phase 5 lifecycle (L-U3b round 2): an image in a session with no usable
# HOME. fx v0.0.16's turn keeps the image's bytes whether or not the session
# is saved (D44, session_store.zig:43-50), so the second request carries it
# again; the gateway log's bodies show it. Nothing is kept in the workspace.
models models-image.json
gateway image-turns.json
work image-ws
work p5-relhome-made
env HOME=relative/homedir
wait 3
type /image shot.png
key Enter
wait 1.5
type  what is in this image?
key Enter
wait 4
snap sent
type describe it again
key Enter
wait 4
snap again
gwlog
workls i00
